{"code":"025870","name":"신라에스지","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1977년 수산물가공 등의 식품제조, 도소매업을 목적으로 설립되어 1995년 코스닥에 상장, 신라에스앤디 보유하고 있음. 주요 사업은 어육소시지와 수산물 가공식품 제조, 축육 도매 및 온라인 유통 등이며, 소시지를 CJ제일제당에 OEM 공급하고 축육 유통은 해외 팩커와 협력하고 있음. 동사는 축육소시지, 기능성 소시지류를 개발하며 축종 확대, 냉장육 신규유통, 미트박스 플랫폼을 통한 온라인 판매영역 확대에 힘쓰고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":1059.0,"open":1059.0,"high":1059.0,"low":1059.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":-50.0472,"ret_120":-76.4143,"ret_250":-80.2793,"ma20":1059.0,"ma60":1729.45,"ma120":2369.55,"ma200":3396.18,"close_vs_ma200":-68.8179,"close_vs_ma60":-38.7667,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-99.6079,"r2_60":0.7737,"slope_120":-95.5259,"r2_120":0.7968,"slope_250":-82.464,"r2_250":0.8118,"high52":6230.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":16.9984,"dd_52w":-83.0016,"mdd_1y":-84.8409,"atr14_pct":57.1429,"vol_ann_60":143.3708,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.0,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":158874644.65,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":33.7732,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":88134.0,"inst_net_60":-14.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":2.2033,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0003,"smart_net_60_pct":2.203,"frgn_net_120":117296.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":2.9324,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":2.9324,"foreign_ratio":3.17,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":2.24,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":8.0,"op_margin_q":4.0,"op_qoq":233.3333,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":300.0,"rev_yoy":11.7318,"op_trend_4q":48.4211,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-11.8,"debt_ratio":206.57,"per":null,"pbr":0.29,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":3.17,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_cha